# Optum
> Provide healthcare services from primary care to specialty care, online pharmacies with more affordable prescriptions, and health benefit accounts to save on medical expenses.

## Products and services
- [Optum](https://www.optum.com/en/): All your health needs in one place, from finding a doctor and scheduling an appointment to signing up for a health benefits account and managing your prescriptions.
- [Optum Home Delivery Pharmacy](https://www.optum.com/en/pharmacy-services/medication-delivery.html): Get medications sent directly to your home with fast shipping and 24/7 access to our licensed pharmacists.
- [Optum Specialty Pharmacy](https://www.optum.com/en/pharmacy-services/specialty-pharmacy.html): For patients that require complex therapies, we offer personalized patient care, communication and resources for special conditions.
- [Optum Infusion Pharmacy](https://www.optum.com/en/pharmacy-services/infusion-pharmacy.html): For patients whose treatments cannot be taken orally or have to be given at a controlled pace, we offer both home infusions and infusion therapies at any of our many locations.
- [Optum Frontier Therapies](https://www.optum.com/en/pharmacy-services/rare-disease-therapies.html): We provide personalized support, simplified access to therapy and compassionate care for patients with rare conditions.
- [Optum Health Savings Accounts](https://www.optum.com/en/financial-services/health-savings-accounts.html): Optum Financial is a leader in HSAs, with tools that help you pay for medical expenses now and save for the future.
- [Optum Flexible Spending Accounts](https://www.optum.com/en/financial-services/flexible-spending-accounts.html): An Optum FSA allows you to set aside pretax funds to cover healthcare costs, using a payment card or paying out of pocket and requesting reimbursement online.
- [Optum Health Reimbursement Arrangements](https://www.optum.com/en/financial-services/health-reimbursement-arrangements.html): An HRA is an employer-funded account that helps you pay for eligible health expenses without using your own money.
- [Optum Lifestyle Spending Accounts](https://www.optum.com/en/financial-services/lifestyle-spending-accounts.html): Employer-funded assistance for lifestyle expenses including wellness, financial planning, childcare, groceries, adoptions and tuition reimbursement.
- [Optum Commuter Benefits](https://www.optum.com/en/financial-services/commuter-benefits.html): Members can save thousands of dollars with pretax funds for taking the train, bus, or commuter highway vehicle, or paying for a parking spot if their company offers these benefits.
- [Optum Care Locations](https://www.optum.com/en/care/locations.html): Find doctors and locations near you for primary care, urgent care and specialty care.
- [Optum Specialty Care and Services](https://www.optum.com/en/care/specialty-care.html): Explore the specialties and services we offer, and connect with your local Optum team to learn what's available in your area.

